{{!--
  LOGOS SCROLL SECTION
  Infinite scrolling logos with fade-in entrance animation
  Uses GSAP for smooth animation and seamless looping

  noScroll — optional. Ghost's Handlebars has no eq/string-compare helper
    (see posts-tabs.hbs's own doc on this same constraint), so this is a
    plain truthy flag, not a scroll="false" string comparison — passing
    noScroll="true" (or any non-empty value) forces the static/no-marquee
    rendering unconditionally; omitting it (every existing call site today)
    changes nothing.
    Independent of this flag, logos-scroll.js ALSO measures at runtime
    whether the real (non-duplicated) logos already fill the container —
    if they do, there is nothing to scroll, so it disables the marquee
    itself regardless of what this param says. noScroll="true" is for
    forcing the static look even when the logos would otherwise overflow
    and could scroll; the runtime check is for the opposite case (logos
    fit, so scrolling would be pointless motion). Both paths converge on
    the same 'is-static' class (see logos-scroll.css's own doc for why one
    class serves two different triggers cleanly).

  The duplicate set below (for the seamless marquee loop) is only rendered
  when noScroll is not set — a static/non-scrolling layout has no seam to
  hide, so shipping a second copy of every logo would be dead markup. The
  RUNTIME "logos already fit" case still gets the duplicate set in the DOM
  (this Handlebars branch can't know that ahead of time), but
  logos-scroll.js hides it via CSS when it decides not to scroll.
--}}

<section class="logos-scroll-section{{#if noScroll}} is-static{{/if}}" id="logos-scroll">
  <div class="logos-scroll-container">
    {{!-- Duplicate logos for seamless infinite scroll --}}
    {{!-- First set --}}

    <div class="logo-item" data-logo="PlayStation">
      <img src="/content/images/logos/PlayStation.svg" alt="PlayStation" class="logo-image" loading="lazy" data-skip-reveal>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-item" data-logo="Vodafone">
      <img src="/content/images/logos/Vodafone.svg" alt="Vodafone" class="logo-image" loading="lazy" data-skip-reveal>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-item" data-logo="GalaChain">
      <img src="/content/images/logos/GalaChain.svg" alt="GalaChain" class="logo-image" loading="lazy" data-skip-reveal>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-item" data-logo="Deutsche_Bank">
      <img src="/content/images/logos/Deutsche_Bank.svg" alt="Deutsche Bank" class="logo-image" loading="lazy" data-skip-reveal>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-item" data-logo="TheBodyShop">
      <img src="/content/images/logos/Tracr.svg" alt="The Body Shop" class="logo-image" loading="lazy" data-skip-reveal>
    </div>
    {{#unless noScroll}}
    {{!-- Duplicate set for seamless loop --}}
    <div class="logo-item" data-logo="GalaChain" data-logo-duplicate>
      <img src="/content/images/logos/GalaChain.svg" alt="GalaChain" class="logo-image" loading="lazy" data-skip-reveal>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-item" data-logo="PlayStation" data-logo-duplicate>
      <img src="/content/images/logos/PlayStation.svg" alt="PlayStation" class="logo-image" loading="lazy" data-skip-reveal>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-item" data-logo="Vodafone" data-logo-duplicate>
      <img src="/content/images/logos/Vodafone.svg" alt="Vodafone" class="logo-image" loading="lazy" data-skip-reveal>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-item" data-logo="Deutsche_Bank" data-logo-duplicate>
      <img src="/content/images/logos/Deutsche_Bank.svg" alt="Deutsche Bank" class="logo-image" loading="lazy" data-skip-reveal>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-item" data-logo="TheBodyShop" data-logo-duplicate>
      <img src="/content/images/logos/Tracr.svg" alt="The Body Shop" class="logo-image" loading="lazy" data-skip-reveal>
    </div>
    {{/unless}}
  </div>
</section>
